WEBVTT

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.350
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.590
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.990
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.030
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.970
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:38.390
The decisive battle with the League of Extraordinary Elects, LXE has ended.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.790
However, Victor was resurrected,

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:46.900
and in the course of battle,
Kazuki takes on Victor's form!

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:52.100
With Victor's flight, the mission is completed.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.780
Kazuki and the others have gone to the beach for a brief vacation, but...

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.840
You don't want to involve the others, do you?

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.810
Let's talk it over tonight...

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:08.180
<i>New Strength</i>

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:12.250
There's no place like the beach...

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.090
An octopus!

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.060
Quit staring at my navel!

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.030
Bravo!

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:27.240
Ohh! Bravo!

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.240
Hey... Where did Okakura go?

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.450
l'm not sure...
But l have a pretty good idea...

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:42.380
Hey there, sugar!
Want to have a cup of tea with me?!

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:44.450
What a funny face...

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:45.480
Hey!

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:46.460
Shoo, shoo!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.300
Boy, do l hate the beach...

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.570
Huh? What's with Okakura?

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.970
l'm not sure...
But l have a pretty good idea...

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.400
Bravo!

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.630
Bravo... Don't be discouraged.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:06.180
Some things are rewarding in the end if you keep on trying.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.610
Shall l give you an example?

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:09.780
Girls!

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.010
Here goes! Bravo Arts, one of 13!

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.190
Warrior Chief!

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:18.220
Enchant! Bravo Kiss.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.420
What?

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.620
For a moment there...

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:23.920
l felt an odd thrill...

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:25.460
Well?

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.470
Master! Please take me under your wing!

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:28.260
Tokiko.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.090
Huh?

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.070
Enchant! Kazuki Kiss.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.740
You ever do that again, and I'll splatter you!

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.510
By the way, l'm the only one who can use this power.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:42.110
Because it's a Bravo Art.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.410
Then what good does it do me?!

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.220
169...170...

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:48.150
Well then, after dinner and a bath at the inn,

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:49.380
it's fireworks at 9:00 p.m.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.220
Roger.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.150
Chee-eese.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.390
About Tokiko's belly button...

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.090
Both brother and sister going on about my navel?!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.590
Kazuki, did anything happen in my absence?

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:04.890
Hmmm, let's see.
The LXE did not appear, and

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:07.930
Chono hasn't shown himself even once...

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:11.640
So, nothing happened.
Peace and harmony is the best!

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:13.780
That's right.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.570
By the way, Bravo.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.340
Hmm?

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.480
When this case is solved,

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.180
would you give me training like you did before?

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:27.460
l'm no match for Victor like this, and if l had been stronger then,

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.750
l may have been able to prevent Victor's restoration...

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.920
My powers are still inadequate.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:36.600
l want to become a stronger Alchemist Warrior!

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.570
200!

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.330
My back is breaking!

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:42.970
Kazuki, let's decide who carries the luggage

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.070
by "rock-paper-scissors."

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.140
Sure.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.180
Kazuki...

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.140
Tonight at 12:00 midnight,

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.050
meet me at the rocky area to the west.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.750
—Let's eat!
—Let's eat!

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:57.190
They all look delicious...!

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.230
Kazuki, you--!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.650
Hand yours over, then!

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:03.700
Like hell l will!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.690
Hey, knock it off, Rokumasu!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.230
Aah, my delicious seafood!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.440
What's wrong, Tokiko?

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.870
Huh? Oh, nothing...

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:17.080
You haven't eaten at all.
Aren't you hungry?

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.940
No, it's not that...

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.140
Well then...

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.950
—Eat up!
—Huh?!

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.990
Ah, well, if you say so...

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.260
Hey, Bravo!

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.570
Huh, where's Tokiko?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:25.940
Sorry to keep you waiting,

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.010
Gota Nakamura.

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.550
l'm so pleased that you remembered.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:32.990
Buso Renkin!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.160
Tell me. Why are you here?

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.090
Your instant activation of the Valkyrie Skirt shows

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.190
that you haven't changed one bit.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:48.500
But...that's the good thing about you, Tokiko.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.000
You helped me a lot back at the training facility.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:54.500
As of this summer, l, Gota Nakamura,

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.570
am officially an Alchemist warrior just like you, Tokiko.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.140
Skip the pleasantries.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.710
Hurry and explain why you are here.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.210
You're cold.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:06.120
But that, too, is one of the good things about you, Tokiko.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.040
What did you call me out here for?

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.090
l'm here to deliver your new assignment from headquarters.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:14.820
lt's the same mission that l've been assigned.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.760
l wonder if she got lost...

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:20.630
Kazuki.

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.530
How much have you heard from Warrior Tokiko

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:25.230
about the main body of our forces?

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.070
How much?

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.100
Just that it is an organization that protects the kakugane,

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:31.870
and defeats the homunculi.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.170
l haven't been told its name yet...

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:36.340
l see. Well then, I'll start from there.

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.380
The organization that binds us
Alchemist Warriors together

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:43.950
is called the Alchemist Army.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.790
The Alchemist Army...?!

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:50.720
Beginning with the Alchemist guilds of medieval England,

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:55.100
it has grown into a secret society governing all Alchemists.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:58.000
lt has three main purposes.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.800
There is one more,

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.500
in addition to the two you have mentioned.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.810
Creation of the Philosopher's stone.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:10.010
Even people who know little of Alchemy will at least have heard of this.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.920
lt is conversion of one form of matter into another,

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.480
whereby base metals are changed into precious metals—

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.990
a source of perennial youth and immortality that converts a limited life into eternal life.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.920
This all-powerful stone represents the crystallization of all of Alchemy

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.960
and makes possible all miracles.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:29.830
As a result of long years of research, one hundred years ago,

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.430
three prototypes based on kakugane

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.870
with serial numbers one to three were finally produced.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:36.430
These became...

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:37.840
The black kakugane!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:38.940
Exactly.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:43.850
And the first person to be chosen as a test subject was Warrior Victor.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:50.180
ln a fierce battle with the homunculi,
Victor sustained damage to his heart,

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.710
so the Alchemist Army transplanted the black kakugane, serial number one,

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.920
giving new life to the man.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.320
The result, as you know, was that Victor changed

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:03.100
into a monster even greater than the homunculi,

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:08.100
and the Alchemist Army was driven to the brink of destruction.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.740
And amidst the chaos,

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.610
all kakugane including the remaining two black kakugane

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:18.210
were scattered over the world and lost.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:21.050
Thereafter, all research on the Philosopher's Stone

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.950
was suspended indefinitely.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:28.360
So the story about Victor turning himself into a homunculi...

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:29.290
Yes...

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.790
That was a cover story developed

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.730
to hide the Alchemist Army's greatest failure.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:39.630
Warrior Tokiko implanted the kakugane in your heart because

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.440
she'd heard of
Victor's transplant experiment,

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:44.440
but details were passed down in a distorted manner.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.210
lt has taken me a whole month to investigate

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:50.840
about Victor and the black kakugane

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:55.820
and an additional month to investigate you, Kazuki...

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:01.620
Results from your hospital tests, the investigations we've conducted,

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.220
analysis of various samples,

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.320
and the records of what transpired in Victor's time,

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:11.030
reveal that your body and the black kakugane have become linked

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:14.300
and can no longer be separated from one another.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.070
ln other words...

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:20.480
You can no longer return to your original human form.

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.650
What are you talking about, Bravo?

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:33.680
Look at me, l'm human right now.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:39.090
There are stages.
You are still at stage one.

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:44.930
lf my calculations are correct, you have about 6 weeks.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.470
By the time summer vacation is over,

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.570
you too will turn into a monster like Victor

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:52.300
who spreads death and destruction simply by existing.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.040
Before that happens, you must be disposed of.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.750
That is my new mission.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:01.210
Bravo?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.780
You were killed by a Homunculus.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:08.250
The life that warrior Tokiko gave you should not have been allowed.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.990
You must be killed once again to set things right.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.160
Bravo...

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:16.370
Kazuki Muto must be re-exterminated!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:21.960
What did you say?!

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.640
What did you mean by that?

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.540
Are you saying you're here to kill Kazuki?!

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:30.380
No, of course not.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:35.250
The job of a rookie is to keep you occupied.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:41.150
Still... l do have the ability and confidence to defeat Kazuki!

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.750
Not you?! Then who?

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:47.060
<i>Someone at this beach,</i> <i>some other warrior...!</i>

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.860
lt couldn't be...

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:57.440
Where are they now?!

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.610
l can't tell you.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.980
As a warrior, my mission is to never divulge it.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:04.650
That's true.
Then I'll search by myself.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.060
Five kilometers east, deep into the craggy area.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.100
Thank you, Gota.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:27.470
l owe you one.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.730
l'm happy that you have achieved your wish of becoming a warrior.

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:31.640
Congratulations.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.810
When Tokiko's not acting tough she's not so bad...

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.820
Wait, what am l doing?!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:39.920
You mustn't, Tokiko!

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.680
lt's dangerous to go now!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.720
Captain Bravo is serious!

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.420
Say it isn't so, Bravo...

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.330
Tell me it isn't so, Bravo...

00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:59.300
lt's a lie!

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:02.200
Lies, lies, lies, lies!

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.630
lt's...a...lie...

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.410
Whether for good or for evil,

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:12.340
there is no shame in holding onto your beliefs until the very end.

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.750
The very words you said when you recruited me as a warrior.

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:19.820
My conviction is to save as many people as l can.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:22.990
And to do that, l am willing to kill a fellow warrior.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:25.900
l would even become evil itself.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:30.190
<i>lt's no lie. What l see before me</i> <i>is the real thing...</i>

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.530
Captain...Bravo...

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.270
Won't you lay down your life?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:39.870
Kazuki!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:44.980
l understand...

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.250
But not now. l won't give up yet!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:53.120
Those same words encouraged me to become an Alchemist Warrior.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:55.420
The same convictions as you!

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:59.670
lf l only have six weeks left as a human being,

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.790
then l shall carry through my convictions to the end!

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:07.400
l will struggle to the end with the life Tokiko has given me! So...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:14.040
<i>You really have gotten stronger, Kazuki...</i>

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:15.280
That's why...

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.280
l intend to fight!

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:23.610
Buso Renkin!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:31.320
There!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.410
<i>Something is wrong with</i> <i>the Sunlight Heart!</i>

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:48.000
<i>ls there still some damage left</i> <i>from the battle with Victor?!</i>

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.180
What's this?

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.520
<i>Just like the records</i> <i>from Victor's time said...</i>

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.250
You yourself have already changed.

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:01.720
The Buso Renkin changes accordingly..

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:04.830
<i>Kazuki will get stronger and stronger.</i>

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.930
<i>So, before he becomes</i> <i>any more powerful...</i>

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:11.500
The Sunlight Heart is changing its form!

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:20.610
This is my new lance?

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.780
Yes. That is your new strength.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:30.420
Take it in your hand.
Try showing me its power.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.860
<i>lt's smaller and lighter than before,</i>

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:40.460
<i>and l can wield it easily with one hand.</i>

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.360
<i>With this, l can execute everything</i> <i>l've learned!</i>

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:44.830
But...

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.700
<i>Your reach has become</i> <i>that much shorter,</i>

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:51.680
<i>and the destructive power</i> <i>has also been reduced.</i>

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.380
<i>Your attack misses its mark.</i>

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.470
<i>Even if you aim correctly,</i> <i>the lance will fail as a weapon</i>

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:58.850
<i>if you lack the power to kill</i> <i>with a single blow.</i>

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:03.090
Reach! Reeeeach!

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.150
What?!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.990
Slash! Bravo Chop!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.390
lt's already begun!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.430
Wait for me! Tokiko!

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.040
l see...

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.240
This new lance is of the internal energy type.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:31.270
lt has the special feature of activating and expanding as needed.

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:33.520
lt is a good lance.

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:39.120
lts size and power can be adjusted to the combat situation...

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:46.390
However, with that Buso Renkin alone, neither l nor the Silver Skin can be beaten.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:48.330
<i>He's strong...</i>

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:50.930
<i>l already knew that,</i> <i>but he's really strong!</i>

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.470
Come at me with everything you've got.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.780
The Warrior Chief commands a domain far superior

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.680
to anything you can imagine.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:04.770
lf you want to once again see the smiles

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:07.650
of your friends, sister, and Warrior Tokiko,

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.350
you should give me everything you've got!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.220
All right..

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.360
Here l come, Bravo!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.770
<i>I'll repel the Silver Skin to end this battle!</i>

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.470
<i>This is the power of</i> <i>the black kakugane,</i>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.030
<i>but the man most deserving</i> <i>of being defeated</i>

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.910
<i>must have powers far greater than this.</i>

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:35.470
<i>lf l cannot prevail against Kazuki,</i> <i>then how could l possibly defeat Victor?!</i>

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.950
lt burst! I'll use this to...

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:47.560
You'll use this to do what?

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:48.790
Wha--?!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.320
Silver Skin, Another Type.

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:54.360
l have taken your most powerful attack.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.330
l, too, shall answer it with everything l've got.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:57.660
Here l come!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:00.340
What's this?!

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.200
Silver Skin Reverse.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:08.250
Silver Skin Reverse?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:14.780
What's this?!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.960
Again...my fist won't move.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.720
Not just your fist.

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.130
You'll find that your entire body is paralyzed.

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.900
That is the effect of
Silver Skin Reverse.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.070
The Silver Skin is an invincible metal jacket

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:35.040
that completely shuts out attacks from the outside,

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.970
but if it is reversed, its characteristics are inverted

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.880
so that no attack on external entities can be launched.

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:42.910
lt becomes an invincible strait jacket

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:45.010
preventing all offensive action by the attacker.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:49.510
Of course, it shuts out not only physical attacks.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:55.320
The Energy Drain has also been regarded as an attack.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.290
This battle has been settled.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.730
Surrender, Kazuki. lt's not too late.

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:05.530
lf it's now, you don't have to wait six weeks and can still die as a human being.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.100
Not yet...

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.110
Those smiles...

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.580
How do you expect me to give up on that?!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:33.430
Another Type of Reverse, the Double Strait.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.700
Farewell, Kazuki Muto.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.630
Bra...vo...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:55.750
<i>Mahiro... Okakura...</i>
<i>Everyone... Toki...ko...</i>

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:17.870
Kazuki!

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:23.250
Halt, Warrior Tokiko. That's an order.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.120
l can't listen to that order.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:29.850
Don't forget that you are a warrior!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:31.950
Cool your head.

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.320
Tokiko!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.760
Warrior Gota...

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:37.920
Sorry!

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.440
<i>Has Kazuki Muto been properly</i> <i>re-exterminated, Sakimori?</i>

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.080
Hiwatari?

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:05.380
Tokiko, are you all right?!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:06.150
Kazuki!

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:08.580
Let go! lf l don't help him soon...

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:12.660
What are you saying?
Calm down! He's already dead.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:14.300
Anyway, with your legs in that shape,

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.920
it would be impossible for you to swim on your own.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.730
l don't care. Let go!
Where are you, Kazuki?!

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.060
Kazuki!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.070
Give up on him, Tokiko!

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:25.770
There's no way Captain Bravo would leave a mission unaccomplished!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:31.210
The re-extermination of Kazuki has been completed.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:36.110
Kazuki...

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:39.320
Kazuki!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:46.120
l will not leave your side.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:49.890
lf there is even a slim hope, l will not give up till the end.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:53.050
The moment you die, is the moment l die!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.060
Next time "When Dawn Comes."

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.230
I'll splatter your guts out!
